,"line":"Christian hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":23,"line":"Village meal: +1190 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":23,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the north. They carried off ~1200 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":23,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~1050 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":24,"line":"Christian hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":24,"line":"Christian hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":25,"line":"Christian hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":25,"line":"⛓️ Wanjiru brings it home: Emberhold bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":26,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Emberhold's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":26,"line":"⛓️ Wanjiru brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":27,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"⛓️ Wanjiru brings it home: Thornfield bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":27,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":27,"line":"🌙 Raid — Ashford came in the night from the southeast. They carried off ~800 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":28,"line":"Christian hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Thornfield's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":29,"line":"Christian hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":29,"line":"Christian hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":29,"line":"Liam hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":29,"line":"Tangaroa hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":29,"line":"Wei hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":29,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~1600 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":30,"line":"Christian hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":30,"line":"Christian hesitates, then